      "html": "<div id=\"step-q221837\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 9</div><div class=\"questionWidget-healthFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-healthBar\" style=\"width: 92%;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Disprove the following statement:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"391\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"3\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> for any <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"399\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2208\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"4\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-ds mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c211D TEX-A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> </p>\n</blockquote>\n</div><div class=\"questionWidget-body\">To <div id=\"selectList-221837-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 4px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelectionMultipleAttempts\" id=\"selectListFrame-221837-0\" style=\"width: 75px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">disprove</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 394px; top: 15285px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">prove</div><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">disprove</div></div></div> a universal statement, it's sufficient to find a <div id=\"selectList-221837-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 4px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-221837-1\" style=\"width: 125px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">counterexample</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 789px; top: 15285px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">counterexample</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">example</div></div></div>. <p></p>In other words, we need to show that <div id=\"selectList-221837-2\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 4px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-221837-2\" style=\"width: 271px; height: 18px; line-height: 18px;\">there exists a real number <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmen